		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_skillteach_kakera_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その　ポケモンは　すでに
おなじ　わざを　おぼえてるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-07-07T08:45:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-07-07T07:16:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その　ポケモンは　すでに
同じ技を　覚えてるよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-07-07T08:45:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
